WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 3]

01:49.020 --> 01:52.300
The Emperor passed away!

01:52.660 --> 01:55.420
Anping Rebellion came to an end.

01:55.900 --> 01:56.700
In this life,

01:57.220 --> 01:59.260
I cut off Xiao Xun's path to throne.

02:00.140 --> 02:02.540
But this game to crush him

02:03.220 --> 02:04.780
has just begun.

02:05.460 --> 02:07.940
Your Highness, congratulations
on getting what you want.

02:09.300 --> 02:10.620
The same to you, Grand Mentor Deng.

02:10.620 --> 02:11.460
[Deng Yi, the Grand Mentor]

02:11.460 --> 02:12.420
You got wealth and honor

02:12.580 --> 02:13.700
as you had longed for.

02:15.540 --> 02:16.980
The Imperial Guard Commander
was involved

02:17.620 --> 02:18.460
and executed.

02:20.100 --> 02:20.820
This position

02:21.740 --> 02:23.060
concerns the entire imperial city

02:23.100 --> 02:24.380
and even the royal clan.

02:25.180 --> 02:25.700
Your Highness.

02:27.660 --> 02:28.420
Anyone in mind?

02:36.820 --> 02:37.340
Jiu.

02:59.060 --> 02:59.620
Your Highness,

03:01.300 --> 03:02.100
what do you mean?

03:03.700 --> 03:05.340
This is my first order.

03:06.220 --> 03:07.300
Fu Jiu, retainer of Chu clan,

03:07.860 --> 03:09.500
will be promoted to
the Imperial Guard Commander.

03:10.020 --> 03:11.300
He can be armed at court.

03:13.140 --> 03:14.180
Any objection, Grand Mentor?

03:30.260 --> 03:31.660
[Imperial Guard]

03:34.100 --> 03:34.900
Don't regret it.

03:36.340 --> 03:37.420
Don't make me regret it.

03:59.100 --> 03:59.700
General!

04:00.140 --> 04:01.740
Urgent message from the Capital!

04:02.140 --> 04:03.820
Urgent message from the Capital!

04:04.740 --> 04:05.380
General!

04:09.220 --> 04:09.700
General,

04:09.860 --> 04:11.060
message from the Capital!

04:15.680 --> 04:16.160
[The Emperor has passed away.]

04:16.160 --> 04:16.560
[In his final decree, he conferred upon]

04:16.560 --> 04:17.080
[Chu Zhao of Chu Clan the title
of Grand Princess of State,]

04:17.080 --> 04:17.440
[and granted her the authority
to oversee state affairs]

04:17.440 --> 04:17.760
[and govern the court
together with the Grand Mentor.]

04:27.420 --> 04:28.300
His Majesty has died.

04:29.020 --> 04:29.540
Zhao...

04:31.220 --> 04:32.340
She's the Grand Princess now.

04:33.780 --> 04:34.860
What on earth has she

04:34.860 --> 04:35.820
gone through?

04:36.420 --> 04:38.660
Complicated infighting in the court

04:39.260 --> 04:40.340
is far more fierce

04:41.060 --> 04:42.380
than that on the frontier.

04:42.900 --> 04:44.540
At least, she's safe now.

04:46.500 --> 04:48.020
Glad she's safe.

04:50.740 --> 04:52.740
General, enemies are invading!

04:54.660 --> 04:55.300
Arm up!

04:55.900 --> 04:56.580
Move out!

05:20.500 --> 05:22.900
His Majesty has arrived.

05:45.420 --> 05:46.060
Zhao.

05:49.300 --> 05:50.300
I want Zhao to be here.

05:50.300 --> 05:51.740
[Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan]

05:51.740 --> 05:53.020
[Xie Yanfang, the Prime Minister]

05:53.020 --> 05:54.260
[Deng Yi, the Grand Mentor]

05:54.260 --> 05:54.900
Your Majesty,

05:55.860 --> 05:57.740
this is inappropriate.

05:59.580 --> 06:00.700
Yeah, Your Majesty.

06:01.260 --> 06:02.700
There is no precedent.

06:03.740 --> 06:04.900
Let the Grand Princess enter.

06:23.460 --> 06:23.980
Yu,

06:24.220 --> 06:24.780
what's wrong?

06:24.940 --> 06:25.500
Zhao,

06:25.780 --> 06:26.860
I don't want to walk alone.

06:27.220 --> 06:28.580
You walk with me, all right?

06:29.340 --> 06:32.020
If a woman interferes with politics,
the state will collapse.

06:32.660 --> 06:34.100
Please behave, Your Highness.

06:37.100 --> 06:38.660
Chamberlain, don't you remember

06:39.580 --> 06:40.700
what happened before?

06:41.380 --> 06:42.700
When Dowager Empress Xie

06:42.700 --> 06:44.020
ruled behind the curtain,

06:44.660 --> 06:45.660
you were the first

06:45.660 --> 06:46.940
to urge the emperor to take the throne.

06:48.180 --> 06:48.700
Your Majesty,

06:49.780 --> 06:50.580
time to move on.

08:00.180 --> 08:01.500
Kneel.

08:03.820 --> 08:07.980
Your Majesty, may you have longevity

08:08.260 --> 08:10.500
and a prosperous reign!

08:13.260 --> 08:14.140
Rise.

08:15.380 --> 08:17.060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

08:42.100 --> 08:42.740
Mr. Xie,

08:43.460 --> 08:44.100
still here?

08:45.660 --> 08:46.740
I've lingered for a moment

08:47.500 --> 08:48.420
to thank you

08:49.060 --> 08:51.060
on His Majesty's behalf.

08:53.340 --> 08:54.580
It's so polite of you, Mr. Xie.

08:54.900 --> 08:55.620
I don't know

08:55.620 --> 08:56.660
how I should reply.

08:58.140 --> 08:59.780
You're from the direct line
of the Xie Clan of Gaoyang.

09:00.500 --> 09:01.100
And by blood,

09:01.100 --> 09:02.540
you're Yu's uncle.

09:03.580 --> 09:05.300
You can call him

09:05.420 --> 09:06.540
by his nickname in private.

09:09.580 --> 09:11.140
Then let me thank you, Your Highness,

09:12.220 --> 09:13.180
on behalf of my clan.

09:13.660 --> 09:14.820
for saving Yu's life

09:15.580 --> 09:17.020
and keeping his throne.

09:17.820 --> 09:18.780
You flatter me, Mr. Xie.

09:19.380 --> 09:20.380
Yu and I will

09:20.900 --> 09:22.580
rely on you and your clan.

09:23.020 --> 09:24.140
You're modest, Your Highness.

09:24.540 --> 09:25.780
I know it perfectly well.

09:26.420 --> 09:27.620
You didn't get where you are

09:27.940 --> 09:29.060
by relying on my clan.

09:29.780 --> 09:31.820
Instead, my clan relied on you.

09:33.300 --> 09:34.020
Otherwise,

09:34.900 --> 09:36.100
I wouldn't have had a position

09:36.700 --> 09:38.580
in the court.

09:39.980 --> 09:41.260
Since we're in the same boat,

09:41.540 --> 09:42.740
forget about the formalities.

09:43.700 --> 09:44.980
When we're outside the court,

09:45.580 --> 09:47.740
I'll call you Yanfang.

09:48.220 --> 09:48.740
All right?

09:52.260 --> 09:53.180
It's my honor.

09:54.300 --> 09:55.860
After you come back here,

09:55.900 --> 09:57.300
you look very well.

09:58.460 --> 09:59.540
I wonder

09:59.860 --> 10:01.020
what illness

10:01.540 --> 10:03.020
made you leave the Capital

10:03.020 --> 10:03.820
for a long recovery.

10:08.260 --> 10:09.580
A long-standing illness.

10:10.460 --> 10:11.660
Thank you for your concern.

10:12.660 --> 10:13.900
In the previous life, he was

10:14.540 --> 10:15.460
best at disguising.

10:16.300 --> 10:17.740
His clan had a century-long history

10:18.060 --> 10:19.020
with profound impact.

10:19.580 --> 10:20.740
To put Xiao Xun off his guard,

10:21.220 --> 10:22.860
he feigned illness
and stayed in Gaoyang.

10:23.460 --> 10:25.060
But he secretly gathered private troops

10:25.420 --> 10:26.420
and expanded his power.

10:27.300 --> 10:28.220
A man like him,

10:28.980 --> 10:30.340
who keeps a low profile,

10:31.100 --> 10:32.860
is more likely to have the last laugh.

10:37.900 --> 10:39.340
Why do you stare at me like that?

10:40.700 --> 10:42.060
Am I untidily dressed?

10:44.380 --> 10:46.340
I was just thinking...

10:47.620 --> 10:48.580
Yanfang,

10:48.900 --> 10:50.980
you're an extraordinary young man.

10:51.460 --> 10:52.540
Among all the ministers,

10:52.900 --> 10:53.780
I've never seen anyone

10:53.780 --> 10:54.820
who could be

10:55.420 --> 10:57.140
even half as smart as you.

10:59.740 --> 11:01.460
I wonder how sincere you are

11:03.060 --> 11:04.140
when you praise me.

11:05.140 --> 11:06.940
Every word I say is sincere.

11:07.780 --> 11:09.220
You're a master strategist.

11:09.820 --> 11:11.460
I'm waiting for you to advise me

11:11.740 --> 11:13.460
on what the Lord of Xiaonan

11:13.460 --> 11:14.300
will do next.

11:16.460 --> 11:17.740
The Lord of Xiaonan

11:18.300 --> 11:19.740
didn't mourn the late emperor

11:20.500 --> 11:22.660
or pay homage to the new emperor.

11:23.380 --> 11:24.420
His ambition

11:24.940 --> 11:25.940
is all too evident.

11:27.220 --> 11:28.620
The Grand Mentor has sent nearby troops

11:29.060 --> 11:30.860
to Xiaonan Prefecture secretly

11:31.420 --> 11:33.380
in the name of hunting
remnants of the rebels.

11:34.300 --> 11:35.180
The Lord of Xiaonan

11:35.180 --> 11:36.500
has schemed for over two decades.

11:37.180 --> 11:38.220
I'm afraid a lot of things

11:38.900 --> 11:40.460
are no longer under the court's control.

11:41.620 --> 11:43.140
Can't we strike first?

11:45.060 --> 11:46.340
Not until we have a just reason.

11:47.340 --> 11:48.820
The Lord of Xiaonan declared

11:49.420 --> 11:50.740
he was overwhelmed with grief

11:51.020 --> 11:52.820
and bedridden
over the late emperor's death.

11:53.660 --> 11:54.900
So, he couldn't come here.

11:56.940 --> 11:58.380
And Yu is his junior.

11:58.940 --> 11:59.740
We must placate him.

12:00.460 --> 12:01.180
What's worse,

12:01.780 --> 12:02.980
foes from the Northern Desert

12:02.980 --> 12:04.180
are lurking on the frontier.

12:05.300 --> 12:07.780
New court, young emperor.
Internal and external troubles.

12:08.740 --> 12:10.620
Our state is too fragile
to survive unrest.

12:11.780 --> 12:13.100
That's why
the late emperor's edict stated

12:13.580 --> 12:15.220
Xiao Xun made contributions
in saving the throne.

12:16.380 --> 12:17.580
Otherwise, his father might

12:17.620 --> 12:18.940
have an excuse for rebellion.

12:19.940 --> 12:20.860
But actually, Xiao Xun

12:20.860 --> 12:22.100
is the mastermind behind this.

12:23.460 --> 12:24.380
He set up the trap

12:24.660 --> 12:26.300
to kill the Crown Prince and Princess.

12:27.100 --> 12:28.940
The Crown Princess is my eldest sister.

12:30.260 --> 12:31.460
She's like my mother.

12:32.820 --> 12:34.340
I'm the mortal enemy

12:35.260 --> 12:36.820
of Xiao Xun and his father.

12:38.020 --> 12:38.740
One day,

12:38.740 --> 12:40.220
I'll kill them with my own hands

12:41.860 --> 12:43.380
to avenge my sister.

12:44.540 --> 12:45.900
But not now.

12:46.780 --> 12:49.060
Xiao Xun appears
to be the imperial uncle.

12:49.660 --> 12:51.460
But actually, he's still a hostage.

12:52.220 --> 12:53.260
Don't worry, Your Highness.

12:54.060 --> 12:55.380
Take everything slowly.

12:56.300 --> 12:57.900
Do not rush things.

13:04.780 --> 13:05.620
I understand.

13:06.940 --> 13:08.700
Thank you for your instructions.

13:09.780 --> 13:11.300
If you have any further confusion,

13:11.860 --> 13:13.140
summon me anytime.

13:23.540 --> 13:24.340
Be careful.

13:26.780 --> 13:27.860
The paths in this palace

13:30.060 --> 13:30.780
are treacherous.

13:47.180 --> 13:48.420
So, someone like Xie Yanfang,

13:48.420 --> 13:49.420
upright and noble,

13:50.220 --> 13:51.500
also wants to kill people

13:51.500 --> 13:52.860
out of hatred.

13:54.420 --> 13:55.380
Since you also intend

13:55.380 --> 13:56.420
to oppose Xiao Xun,

13:57.060 --> 13:58.060
then don't blame me

13:58.060 --> 13:59.340
for taking advantage of you.

14:06.140 --> 14:07.220
The Xie Clan of Gaoyang

14:07.620 --> 14:09.980
came to rescue
with 5,000 private troops.

14:10.420 --> 14:11.300
It's him.

14:12.500 --> 14:13.420
The Xie Clan.

14:13.460 --> 14:14.140
We heard

14:14.340 --> 14:16.740
your mother worked in a brothel.

14:17.140 --> 14:17.900
Our clan

14:17.940 --> 14:19.060
doesn't want dirty people.

14:19.620 --> 14:20.420
Since

14:20.700 --> 14:22.540
you're just like your mother,

14:23.060 --> 14:25.380
how about we pierce your ear

14:25.500 --> 14:26.500
and dress you up?

14:26.780 --> 14:28.300
Maybe you'll fetch a good price.

14:28.740 --> 14:29.620
You can endure a lot.

14:29.700 --> 14:30.340
One more.

14:31.700 --> 14:32.220
Stop.

14:33.740 --> 14:35.500
Uncle, it's really kind of you.

14:35.940 --> 14:37.620
You even pity an illegitimate child.

14:38.260 --> 14:38.860
Xie Xiao,

14:39.100 --> 14:40.340
you and your peers bullied

14:40.340 --> 14:41.100
the weak boy.

14:41.580 --> 14:43.100
Do you know how you should be punished?

14:43.620 --> 14:44.380
Do you want me

14:44.780 --> 14:46.420
to take you to the ancestral hall

14:46.460 --> 14:47.420
and make you kneel?

14:48.220 --> 14:49.220
Uncle, we're wrong.

14:49.540 --> 14:50.260
We'll leave now.

14:56.380 --> 14:56.980
It hurts, huh?

14:57.380 --> 14:58.220
Go get some medicine.

15:00.380 --> 15:00.820
No need.

15:02.500 --> 15:03.620
Your ear...

15:04.380 --> 15:05.420
Why do you wear that?

15:06.100 --> 15:07.220
If people see it...

15:07.500 --> 15:08.940
I'm not afraid of being seen.

15:09.860 --> 15:10.420
This

15:10.740 --> 15:12.540
will become part of my flesh and blood

15:13.380 --> 15:14.860
and remind me day after day

15:15.220 --> 15:15.860
not to forget

15:16.740 --> 15:17.660
how they pierced

15:18.220 --> 15:19.300
my ear.

15:19.780 --> 15:20.620
And one day,

15:21.740 --> 15:22.500
they will be pierced

15:23.020 --> 15:24.300
by me.

15:24.860 --> 15:25.380
How daring!

15:26.020 --> 15:27.340
How dare you rebel?

15:27.860 --> 15:29.340
Your whole clan may be executed!

15:32.020 --> 15:33.100
That's just what I want.

15:34.780 --> 15:35.580
Congrats, Yanlai.

15:38.380 --> 15:40.100
With the Commander's token,

15:41.620 --> 15:42.580
you look impressive.

15:44.780 --> 15:46.180
The Grand Princess

15:47.660 --> 15:48.940
isn't as weak

15:48.980 --> 15:49.740
as you think she is.

15:50.500 --> 15:51.660
She's indeed extraordinary.

15:53.860 --> 15:55.260
You worked for Chu Ling

15:55.260 --> 15:56.420
for so many years.

15:57.340 --> 15:58.940
You know more about Miss Chu

15:59.380 --> 16:00.860
than I do.

16:01.980 --> 16:03.620
She acted perfectly.

16:05.500 --> 16:06.420
But sadly,

16:07.500 --> 16:08.740
she's way too impatient.

16:09.980 --> 16:10.900
I'm quite curious.

16:11.980 --> 16:13.260
Why did she suddenly

16:13.260 --> 16:13.980
hate Xiao Xun?

16:15.020 --> 16:16.260
How did this engaged couple

16:16.460 --> 16:17.820
become estranged?

16:19.020 --> 16:20.700
Why can't they get along?

16:21.900 --> 16:23.260
From the very beginning,

16:24.900 --> 16:26.500
Xiao Xun wasn't after Chu Zhao,

16:28.020 --> 16:29.060
but the frontier troops

16:29.100 --> 16:30.100
under Chu Ling's control.

16:30.780 --> 16:31.540
She would notice it

16:32.460 --> 16:33.340
if she weren't a fool.

16:37.620 --> 16:38.740
It sounds like...

16:41.020 --> 16:42.660
Yanlai, you think she's clever.

16:44.620 --> 16:45.860
I've never heard you

16:46.500 --> 16:48.460
praise anyone else like that.

16:53.460 --> 16:54.820
The way you look at her...

16:57.460 --> 16:58.620
It's like how you look

16:58.620 --> 17:00.100
at your pet.

17:01.380 --> 17:02.020
However,

17:03.020 --> 17:03.620
she's a wolf

17:03.620 --> 17:04.900
growing up in the desert.

17:06.260 --> 17:07.020
If you're careless,

17:08.260 --> 17:09.860
she'll bite through your neck.

17:10.900 --> 17:12.620
What's bad about a biting wolf?

17:15.220 --> 17:17.420
Isn't that funnier than a dog

17:17.980 --> 17:18.620
wagging its tail?

17:20.740 --> 17:22.020
Yanlai, you know that.

17:22.900 --> 17:24.380
I always like clever people.

17:31.980 --> 17:33.020
I've made my point.

17:34.300 --> 17:35.180
Young Master Xie,

17:36.220 --> 17:37.340
be careful not to get burned.

17:53.780 --> 17:55.060
Thank you for your concern.

17:56.180 --> 17:57.020
When you have time,

17:58.580 --> 17:59.780
come back home.

18:01.180 --> 18:01.820
After all,

18:03.820 --> 18:04.660
you're a Xie.

18:18.580 --> 18:20.980
[Xie]

18:21.080 --> 18:24.800
[Xie Yanlai,
the Imperial Guard Commander]

18:28.180 --> 18:29.100
Now you know

18:30.060 --> 18:30.940
why the Imperial Guard Tally

18:30.980 --> 18:31.980
can't be given to Fu Jiu.

18:33.020 --> 18:33.700
He's a Xie.

18:34.500 --> 18:36.060
He's the ninth child of Xie Family,

18:37.420 --> 18:38.420
Xie Yanlai.

18:40.260 --> 18:40.940
I know.

18:43.020 --> 18:43.620
You know?

18:46.980 --> 18:48.460
He worked for my father for five years

18:48.500 --> 18:49.700
under a false name.

18:50.020 --> 18:51.100
How could he not be exposed?

18:52.060 --> 18:53.300
You think my father's troops

18:53.300 --> 18:54.620
didn't know his identity?

18:55.740 --> 18:56.540
They did.

18:57.060 --> 18:58.140
They just didn't care.

18:59.700 --> 19:01.500
Whether he's Fu Jiu or Xie Yanlai,

19:02.340 --> 19:03.740
if he had ill intentions

19:04.100 --> 19:05.660
or harmed frontier troops,

19:06.180 --> 19:08.020
my father would punish him accordingly.

19:09.740 --> 19:10.940
But you gave the Tally

19:10.980 --> 19:12.140
to someone from the Xie Clan.

19:12.900 --> 19:14.420
Do you know what that means?

19:19.060 --> 19:20.100
Calm down, Grand Mentor.

19:23.500 --> 19:24.500
I can give you

19:25.540 --> 19:26.260
more.

19:33.940 --> 19:35.500
Seven shops in Yongfeng Alley

19:35.900 --> 19:37.700
will be put under your name tomorrow.

19:38.020 --> 19:39.380
Glazed cups and glowing pearls

19:39.540 --> 19:41.060
aren't rare.

19:41.940 --> 19:43.180
Two boxes have been sent to you.

19:43.540 --> 19:44.900
Feel free to enjoy them.

19:46.260 --> 19:47.700
If you need anything else,

19:47.940 --> 19:49.260
don't hesitate to tell me.

19:50.220 --> 19:51.940
I'll do my best

19:51.980 --> 19:53.140
to get it for you.

19:56.260 --> 19:57.300
Why, Your Highness?

19:59.220 --> 20:00.380
Do you know

20:01.060 --> 20:02.900
why the palace walls
can stand for a century?

20:03.780 --> 20:05.540
Because every brick

20:06.060 --> 20:07.940
stays where it belongs.

20:08.860 --> 20:09.860
I made Xie Yanlai

20:09.860 --> 20:10.900
the Imperial Guard Commander.

20:11.420 --> 20:12.660
But I'll count on you

20:12.940 --> 20:14.260
for court affairs.

20:15.340 --> 20:16.700
So rest assured, Mr. Deng.

20:17.660 --> 20:19.100
Before I'm no longer the princess,

20:19.740 --> 20:20.700
your position

20:21.260 --> 20:22.980
will be rock-solid.

20:27.020 --> 20:28.060
I will

20:29.420 --> 20:30.660
spare no effort.

20:34.780 --> 20:36.260
I've heard your mother

20:37.060 --> 20:38.420
has been missing the hometown.

20:39.020 --> 20:40.100
So I sent men at full gallop

20:40.220 --> 20:41.140
to bring some millet

20:41.140 --> 20:42.540
from your hometown.

20:44.060 --> 20:44.940
It's nothing.

20:45.940 --> 20:47.660
Hearing you're a very good son,

20:48.300 --> 20:49.700
I'm just offering a little present.

20:52.020 --> 20:52.620
I...

20:53.700 --> 20:55.020
Thank you for your consideration.

20:57.500 --> 20:59.620
Everyone has his weakness.

21:00.420 --> 21:02.100
So do you, Deng Yi.

21:13.220 --> 21:15.220
Xie Yanfang is famous
throughout the state.

21:16.220 --> 21:18.220
But he still can't resist flattery.

21:19.220 --> 21:20.660
Since he likes obedient people,

21:22.180 --> 21:24.900
I'll sheathe my claws before him.

21:25.900 --> 21:26.740
As for Deng Yi...

21:28.820 --> 21:31.100
He's greedy and filial to his mother.

21:32.540 --> 21:33.900
I'll just give him what he wants.

21:39.500 --> 21:40.700
Xie Yanlai.

21:53.700 --> 21:55.300
All the ministers are fierce.

21:56.380 --> 21:57.300
He's the only one...

21:58.820 --> 22:00.700
Who protects me with his own life.

22:05.980 --> 22:06.860
[Xie Yanlai]

22:06.940 --> 22:07.580
Jiu.

22:08.660 --> 22:10.060
I can trust you.

22:11.500 --> 22:12.020
Right?

22:37.140 --> 22:38.500
How dare you, an illegitimate son,

22:38.660 --> 22:40.820
burn the ancestors' tablets?

22:41.220 --> 22:43.500
You even angered your father to death.

22:43.940 --> 22:44.700
Believe it or not,

22:44.980 --> 22:46.140
I'll dig your mother out

22:46.180 --> 22:47.420
and feed her to the dogs.

22:47.540 --> 22:48.060
Lowborn!

22:48.140 --> 22:49.020
You bring bad luck.

22:50.420 --> 22:51.100
Lowborn!

22:51.420 --> 22:52.180
Kill him!

22:52.220 --> 22:53.340
Hit him hard!

23:00.980 --> 23:02.460
Are you killing Yanlai, Great-uncle?

23:03.100 --> 23:04.260
Father has just died.

23:04.540 --> 23:06.420
Do you want
to lose another family member?

23:06.740 --> 23:09.260
But he burned the ancestral hall.

23:09.260 --> 23:09.660
Right!

23:09.700 --> 23:10.940
Without descendants,

23:11.540 --> 23:12.740
what do we need the hall for?

23:13.700 --> 23:15.140
By killing a Xie descendant,

23:15.460 --> 23:17.020
will you answer to our ancestors?

23:26.500 --> 23:27.060
Yanlai.

23:32.540 --> 23:33.060
Yanlai.

23:35.940 --> 23:37.580
In childhood, you were afraid of pain.

23:39.100 --> 23:40.060
You cried in the barn

23:40.380 --> 23:41.140
for an hour

23:41.180 --> 23:42.220
over your scraped knee.

23:43.820 --> 23:45.260
But today, you endured 18 lashes.

23:45.540 --> 23:46.940
Like a different person.

23:49.900 --> 23:50.540
I'm Fu Jiu.

23:52.060 --> 23:52.900
I'm not your brother.

24:04.500 --> 24:05.740
I remember, when you were ten,

24:09.540 --> 24:11.140
you stole my books to pad the manger.

24:13.420 --> 24:14.500
I chased to the west yard

24:15.820 --> 24:17.140
and saw you wrapping

24:17.500 --> 24:19.340
a crippled dog in the doghouse.

24:19.820 --> 24:20.940
At that time, you said

24:21.340 --> 24:22.420
everything had a soul.

24:23.940 --> 24:25.500
A crippled dog shouldn't be discarded.

24:26.900 --> 24:27.940
But now, what's going on?

24:28.660 --> 24:29.820
When you're discarded,

24:30.860 --> 24:32.180
why do you let their words

24:32.260 --> 24:32.900
get to you?

24:33.140 --> 24:34.140
You're just like them!

24:35.740 --> 24:37.100
You look down on my mother and me.

24:38.060 --> 24:39.340
Why are you pretending

24:39.380 --> 24:40.420
to be a caring brother?

24:51.620 --> 24:53.460
I am your elder brother.

24:55.180 --> 24:56.380
I don't need to pretend.

25:31.500 --> 25:32.780
Jiu, you haven't fully recovered.

25:33.060 --> 25:34.220
Why are you on night duty?

25:36.900 --> 25:38.100
It's not appropriate for you

25:39.260 --> 25:39.900
to come so late.

25:43.060 --> 25:44.620
I'm just here to give you a cloak.

25:45.460 --> 25:46.700
You won't reject it,

25:47.020 --> 25:48.140
will you?

25:51.620 --> 25:52.580
I'm used to cotton.

25:53.660 --> 25:54.700
I won't like

25:55.700 --> 25:56.340
fancy fabrics.

26:05.100 --> 26:06.020
Cotton is too soft

26:07.180 --> 26:08.140
to guard against arrows.

26:10.420 --> 26:11.300
Don't you agree?

26:13.620 --> 26:14.860
Mr. Xie Yanlai.

26:30.500 --> 26:32.740
Your Highness, are you testing me

26:34.980 --> 26:35.980
or trying to win me over?

26:36.700 --> 26:37.940
I heard

26:38.820 --> 26:40.340
when you served under my father,

26:41.020 --> 26:42.980
you didn't bat an eye
when breaking through ranks

26:43.340 --> 26:44.500
and pulled down the flag.

26:45.980 --> 26:47.020
But now,

26:48.180 --> 26:49.860
why are you afraid of a cloak?

26:51.660 --> 26:52.220
Afraid?

26:54.660 --> 26:55.420
Now I have

26:55.500 --> 26:56.540
the Imperial Guard Tally.

26:58.380 --> 26:59.380
Shouldn't you

27:02.220 --> 27:04.100
be the one who is afraid?

27:07.540 --> 27:08.540
I am afraid.

27:09.220 --> 27:10.700
Covert schemes are harder to dodge

27:11.420 --> 27:13.260
than open attacks on the frontier.

27:14.540 --> 27:16.780
So, Mr. Xie, will you consider

27:21.540 --> 27:22.780
becoming my ally?

28:11.260 --> 28:12.860
Now, you know who I am.

28:14.420 --> 28:15.980
Why do you think I'll pick your side

28:17.940 --> 28:18.940
instead of my own clan?

28:32.540 --> 28:34.300
Because I'll prove to you

28:34.740 --> 28:35.980
I'm more worthy of your support

28:36.660 --> 28:38.100
than Xie Yanfang.

28:38.500 --> 28:39.300
Is this a deal

28:40.140 --> 28:40.860
or an order?

28:52.820 --> 28:54.020
It is a request.

29:08.620 --> 29:09.540
Your Highness,

29:10.660 --> 29:11.540
you're powerful now.

29:12.340 --> 29:13.100
Your request

29:13.380 --> 29:14.300
is too much for me.

29:15.620 --> 29:16.260
Let alone

29:16.860 --> 29:17.900
the support thing.

29:21.020 --> 29:21.700
You'd better

29:25.820 --> 29:26.740
take the cloak back.

29:44.900 --> 29:47.860
Life is like a game. Nothing is set yet.

29:49.100 --> 29:50.660
Jiu, it's a little rash of you

29:51.100 --> 29:52.380
to reject me so firmly.

30:00.580 --> 30:01.740
If one day,

30:02.700 --> 30:04.100
you change your mind,

30:04.820 --> 30:05.660
come to me

30:06.460 --> 30:07.540
anytime.

30:35.700 --> 30:36.460
Congratulations.

30:37.300 --> 30:38.900
You've become the Grand Princess

30:39.300 --> 30:41.580
and gained the supreme power.

30:42.100 --> 30:44.500
You can finally take revenge.

30:44.980 --> 30:45.420
No.

30:48.380 --> 30:49.460
I want more than that.

30:50.580 --> 30:51.340
Don't you remember

30:51.380 --> 30:52.740
how Xiao Xun strangled you,

30:53.100 --> 30:54.540
how he cut off your father's head,

30:54.620 --> 30:56.220
and how he annihilated your clan?

30:56.420 --> 30:57.860
Even if you have to lose your life,

30:58.180 --> 30:59.700
you should make Xiao Xun

30:59.820 --> 31:01.260
pay blood for blood!

31:02.060 --> 31:03.140
Nothing but hatred

31:03.220 --> 31:04.180
can get you up

31:04.180 --> 31:05.260
to the peak of power.

31:05.740 --> 31:06.820
Nothing but hatred

31:07.260 --> 31:08.980
can make you use everyone,

31:09.220 --> 31:10.420
especially men.

31:10.700 --> 31:12.100
They're greedy for power

31:12.540 --> 31:13.740
and beautiful women.

31:14.620 --> 31:15.700
If you don't mind,

31:16.420 --> 31:17.500
they will do anything

31:17.580 --> 31:18.700
for you.

31:19.380 --> 31:20.060
By then,

31:20.980 --> 31:21.700
you'll be able

31:21.700 --> 31:23.580
to take revenge without bloodshed.

31:25.380 --> 31:26.380
Revenge.

31:29.580 --> 31:31.140
That's not my only desire.

31:31.340 --> 31:32.580
I do hate Xiao Xun.

31:33.020 --> 31:34.060
I also want to cut off

31:34.060 --> 31:35.100
his path to success

31:35.380 --> 31:36.340
and ruin everything

31:36.340 --> 31:37.660
he longs for.

31:39.060 --> 31:40.780
To make all this happen,

31:41.900 --> 31:43.420
I have to hide my abilities

31:43.820 --> 31:45.780
and conceal my edge for further action.

31:46.700 --> 31:48.500
With everything you have now?

31:49.180 --> 31:49.940
You're a princess

31:49.940 --> 31:51.420
in name only.

31:52.180 --> 31:53.540
Xiao Xun is the imperial uncle.

31:54.140 --> 31:55.460
Deng Yi oversees the court.

31:55.780 --> 31:57.300
The Xie Clan has accumulated merit.

31:57.540 --> 31:58.300
What do you have?

31:58.460 --> 32:00.180
What makes you think you can fight them?

32:00.980 --> 32:02.060
Didn't you risk your life

32:02.060 --> 32:03.100
to become the Grand Princess

32:03.580 --> 32:05.620
just because you wanted Xiao Xun
to regret it

32:06.060 --> 32:07.820
and wanted to slice him

32:07.820 --> 32:10.140
by the blade of power?

32:15.620 --> 32:16.180
No.

32:17.540 --> 32:18.980
I want more than this.

32:22.060 --> 32:23.580
I want to rule behind the curtain.

32:24.740 --> 32:26.140
I want the real power.

32:27.900 --> 32:29.660
I'll make my father and me

32:30.980 --> 32:32.820
live a long life.

32:36.980 --> 32:38.300
What I want is...

32:40.020 --> 32:42.300
Fate won't repeat itself.

32:58.940 --> 32:59.460
What?

33:00.260 --> 33:01.060
Yeah.

33:01.420 --> 33:02.900
The Grand Princess is here.

33:03.020 --> 33:04.260
That's utterly improper.

33:04.340 --> 33:05.740
It has never happened before.

33:06.020 --> 33:06.660
Indeed.

33:09.780 --> 33:11.460
Your Highness, it was all right

33:11.460 --> 33:14.100
that you attended
the enthronement ceremony.

33:15.260 --> 33:16.580
But now,

33:16.580 --> 33:18.620
how can you even attend court?

33:19.900 --> 33:22.820
Are you trying to rule
behind the curtain

33:23.460 --> 33:25.140
just like Dowager Empress Xie?

33:25.220 --> 33:25.860
That's right.

33:26.540 --> 33:27.540
This is ridiculous.

33:27.540 --> 33:28.500
Outrageous, indeed.

33:29.980 --> 33:31.540
Who does she think she is?

33:31.660 --> 33:32.300
Come on.

33:33.060 --> 33:34.100
Ministers,

33:34.540 --> 33:36.220
my duty is to oversee the court.

33:36.900 --> 33:38.420
His Majesty will rule sooner or later.

33:38.660 --> 33:40.500
His Majesty should attend court.

33:40.620 --> 33:41.860
Who made the rule

33:41.940 --> 33:42.980
that Your Highness can attend court?

33:43.300 --> 33:44.860
Good question, Mr. Qin.

33:45.420 --> 33:47.220
A few days ago, you failed your duty.

33:47.500 --> 33:49.420
By law, you should have been executed.

33:50.220 --> 33:51.620
On the pretext of your military merit,

33:51.700 --> 33:52.900
you were given a minor penalty.

33:53.100 --> 33:54.260
I also want to ask you.

33:54.340 --> 33:55.900
Who made that rule?

33:57.820 --> 33:59.460
We've been sparing no effort

33:59.580 --> 34:00.620
for our state.

34:00.740 --> 34:02.460
But now, in the court,

34:02.540 --> 34:04.260
a woman outside the royal clan

34:04.380 --> 34:05.420
takes charge of politics.

34:05.740 --> 34:06.860
Isn't that ridiculous?

34:07.300 --> 34:08.660
Yeah. That's outrageous.

34:08.820 --> 34:10.220
That's right. That's absurd.

34:10.260 --> 34:11.100
Chamberlain,

34:11.660 --> 34:14.180
you're the father-in-law
of the Third Prince

34:14.540 --> 34:16.340
who killed his elder brother.

34:17.020 --> 34:18.820
If His Majesty hadn't shown mercy,

34:19.140 --> 34:20.300
you wouldn't be standing here

34:20.300 --> 34:22.140
and ranting.

34:22.500 --> 34:23.820
Instead of feeling grateful,

34:23.900 --> 34:25.540
you make things difficult.

34:26.300 --> 34:28.380
Aren't you biting the hand
that feeds you?

34:28.860 --> 34:30.980
It's perceptive of you, Mr. Deng.

34:32.140 --> 34:33.460
You've figured out everything

34:33.900 --> 34:35.060
about all the ministers.

34:35.620 --> 34:37.020
How admirable.

34:37.620 --> 34:38.980
Within only a few days,

34:39.460 --> 34:41.100
you've put in so much effort.

34:41.900 --> 34:43.740
This is truly a blessing for this state.

34:44.620 --> 34:46.540
When you assist His Majesty so well,

34:46.980 --> 34:48.940
our state will be peaceful.

34:49.380 --> 34:51.220
Entrusted by the late emperor,

34:51.460 --> 34:53.100
I dare not slack off in my duty.

34:53.500 --> 34:55.500
Mr. Xie, you used to be sick

34:55.740 --> 34:56.980
and away from court for years.

34:57.140 --> 34:58.700
When you're back here,

34:59.260 --> 35:01.300
you must have a lot of confusions.

35:02.260 --> 35:03.500
If you want to discuss anything

35:03.540 --> 35:04.500
with me,

35:04.860 --> 35:06.660
I'm always at your service.

35:08.100 --> 35:08.620
Ministers,

35:09.180 --> 35:10.300
present your reports.

35:10.660 --> 35:11.820
Or the court is dismissed.

35:12.780 --> 35:13.180
But...

35:13.660 --> 35:14.900
This...

35:15.820 --> 35:16.780
How could she say that?

35:17.660 --> 35:19.460
What a breach of rules.

35:22.140 --> 35:23.340
Who does she think she is?

35:23.420 --> 35:25.340
She has no right to say that.

35:25.340 --> 35:26.580
She oversteps her authority.

35:26.900 --> 35:27.260
She...

35:27.740 --> 35:29.060
She's being presumptuous.

35:29.900 --> 35:30.220
Yeah.

35:30.420 --> 35:31.500
Who would accept that?

35:31.620 --> 35:32.220
Yeah.

35:33.220 --> 35:33.820
Commander Xie.

35:38.020 --> 35:39.020
Her Highness ordered!

35:39.780 --> 35:40.860
Present your reports!

35:41.860 --> 35:42.980
Or the court is dismissed!

35:52.140 --> 35:52.740
I...

35:53.260 --> 35:54.620
I have something to report.

35:56.340 --> 35:57.100
Recently, I dreamed

35:58.220 --> 35:59.580
that the late emperor wept blood

36:00.420 --> 36:01.700
and wanted a sacrifice
at the Ancestral Temple​.

36:03.020 --> 36:03.980
The late emperor should

36:04.220 --> 36:05.580
cry out to the current emperor.

36:05.860 --> 36:07.580
Why would a hostage like you

36:07.780 --> 36:08.980
say such things?

36:09.820 --> 36:11.740
In that case, Mr. Xiao must have

36:12.220 --> 36:14.100
a close connection with the late emperor

36:14.540 --> 36:15.700
because they're blood-related.

36:15.900 --> 36:17.300
But oddly enough...

36:18.380 --> 36:19.420
Mr. Xiao,

36:19.740 --> 36:21.900
why didn't you dream
of the Crown Prince?

36:22.340 --> 36:24.020
Does the late emperor also think

36:24.420 --> 36:25.700
your branch is closer to him

36:26.260 --> 36:27.940
than the Crown Prince?

36:29.580 --> 36:30.260
So, last night,

36:30.620 --> 36:32.580
Grandfather appeared in Uncle's dream.

36:33.060 --> 36:34.700
He must have been angry with me.

36:35.620 --> 36:37.780
In the past few days,
he often came into my dreams,

36:38.180 --> 36:39.620
saying he would fly a kite with me.

36:40.060 --> 36:41.300
But last night, he didn't appear.

36:41.380 --> 36:42.260
Yu.

36:50.740 --> 36:52.220
Your Highness,

36:53.020 --> 36:54.540
what do you think we should do?

37:02.140 --> 37:03.860
Since His Majesty had dreams,

37:04.620 --> 37:07.420
Mr. Deng and Mr. Xie

37:07.580 --> 37:09.460
shall prepare for the sacrifice thing.

37:10.260 --> 37:13.220
We'll do our best.

37:28.060 --> 37:29.340
It's so tiring to attend court.

37:30.020 --> 37:31.500
Can I not go tomorrow?

37:32.980 --> 37:33.660
Yu,

37:34.060 --> 37:35.500
an emperor must put the state first

37:35.900 --> 37:37.380
instead of complaining all the time.

37:39.860 --> 37:40.940
Where's my Nine-ring Puzzle?

37:41.340 --> 37:41.980
Back there.

37:43.860 --> 37:44.740
Watch your step.

37:44.900 --> 37:45.700
Don't trip.

37:45.740 --> 37:46.260
All right.

37:51.860 --> 37:53.060
Without requesting an audience,

37:53.340 --> 37:54.380
I came in here uninvited.

37:55.420 --> 37:56.820
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

38:00.540 --> 38:02.460
You're Yu's close family.

38:03.100 --> 38:04.700
And now I'm his sister.

38:05.180 --> 38:06.340
You and I are close too.

38:07.740 --> 38:09.180
You don't need to inform others

38:09.500 --> 38:10.980
before you visit Yu.

38:11.940 --> 38:12.980
But now,

38:13.100 --> 38:14.660
he's the Emperor, after all.

38:15.100 --> 38:16.060
I hope

38:17.020 --> 38:18.460
you'll inform me next time

38:19.260 --> 38:21.340
so that I can be prepared.

38:23.740 --> 38:24.700
I'll keep that in mind.

38:29.020 --> 38:29.500
Yu.

38:35.060 --> 38:35.740
I'm your...

38:35.980 --> 38:36.620
Uncle.

38:37.180 --> 38:38.020
Be careful.

38:45.780 --> 38:46.540
I heard you brought a toy

38:46.540 --> 38:47.340
to today's court.

38:48.180 --> 38:49.820
It's just a Nine-ring Puzzle.

38:54.660 --> 38:55.140
Give it to me.

38:57.260 --> 38:58.460
I know I was wrong.

39:04.020 --> 39:04.700
Never do it again.

39:13.340 --> 39:13.980
Yu,

39:14.940 --> 39:16.380
this is Mr. Xie Yanfang

39:16.460 --> 39:17.260
from the Xie Clan.

39:17.940 --> 39:18.940
He's also your uncle.

39:22.460 --> 39:23.580
Xie Yanfang?

39:25.860 --> 39:26.660
Oh, the Third Uncle.

39:38.540 --> 39:39.340
Yu,

39:41.620 --> 39:43.140
I know you hate

39:43.300 --> 39:44.500
my clan and me.

39:45.180 --> 39:46.220
We failed to protect

39:46.220 --> 39:47.260
your parents

39:47.460 --> 39:48.100
as well as you.

39:49.140 --> 39:50.380
So, I came here today

39:50.780 --> 39:51.940
to apologize to you.

39:54.500 --> 39:55.220
From now on,

39:56.060 --> 39:57.260
I'll spare no effort

39:58.300 --> 39:59.260
to keep you safe.

40:01.180 --> 40:01.860
Yu,

40:02.540 --> 40:03.900
it's time for morning classes.

40:04.260 --> 40:05.580
Go wait for me in the study,

40:05.660 --> 40:06.340
will you?

40:16.020 --> 40:17.300
He's a kid

40:17.740 --> 40:19.540
and it's normal that he doesn't know

40:20.180 --> 40:21.340
how to hide his emotions.

40:27.060 --> 40:28.620
Don't bother to console me.

40:29.780 --> 40:31.220
We do feel sorry for the massacre

40:31.740 --> 40:32.940
of the Crown Prince's family.

40:34.820 --> 40:35.940
We arrived too late

40:35.980 --> 40:37.060
to protect them.

40:38.540 --> 40:40.100
Yu harbors some resentment

40:41.500 --> 40:42.460
and I understand.

40:44.020 --> 40:44.980
Yu is still young.

40:45.780 --> 40:46.820
After such a tragedy,

40:47.500 --> 40:49.060
his temperament changed somewhat.

40:49.900 --> 40:51.180
Later on, he'll get better.

40:52.860 --> 40:53.820
Next time you come,

40:54.820 --> 40:56.060
bring him some toys

40:56.900 --> 40:58.060
and that might cheer him up.

41:05.020 --> 41:05.780
How rare.

41:07.740 --> 41:09.220
The two of you

41:10.100 --> 41:11.460
match well in character.

41:17.940 --> 41:19.460
How enviable.

41:21.300 --> 41:21.820
Yeah.

41:23.180 --> 41:24.740
Commander Xie is exceptionally brave.

41:25.580 --> 41:26.900
I admire him a lot.

41:27.500 --> 41:29.100
I'll count on him

41:29.380 --> 41:30.860
for the safety of the imperial palace.

41:49.380 --> 41:51.220
You know Xie Yanfang is suspicious.

41:52.180 --> 41:53.260
But in front of him,

41:53.460 --> 41:55.020
you pretended to think highly of me.

41:55.780 --> 41:56.620
What were you up to?

41:56.820 --> 41:58.220
You didn't deny it just now.

41:59.220 --> 42:00.060
So, you agreed

42:00.060 --> 42:01.500
that I was telling the truth.

42:03.420 --> 42:04.820
Does it mean

42:07.260 --> 42:08.380
you've accepted my offer?

42:16.300 --> 42:17.820
It's my duty to protect Your Highness.

42:19.140 --> 42:20.220
Not because of your offer.

42:20.700 --> 42:21.820
Then have you decided?

42:23.340 --> 42:24.900
Once you're the Commander,

42:26.460 --> 42:28.220
you won't go back to Yunzhong.

42:30.060 --> 42:31.260
I was a retainer of your family.

42:33.180 --> 42:34.180
I don't care about that.

42:35.100 --> 42:35.780
As for you,

42:36.540 --> 42:37.540
the Grand Princess,

42:38.660 --> 42:40.220
there's really no turning back.

42:48.500 --> 42:49.700
Is this

42:51.460 --> 42:52.660
what you really want?

42:55.580 --> 42:57.300
Xie Yanfang is the head of ministers.

42:57.940 --> 42:58.940
Deng Yi controls speech.

42:59.700 --> 43:01.780
Xiao Xun owns Xiaonan Prefecture.

43:02.580 --> 43:03.380
But you...

43:04.900 --> 43:05.780
What do you have?

43:14.140 --> 43:15.060
I have you

43:15.140 --> 43:16.340
who will risk his life for me.

43:30.300 --> 43:31.740
Two against two. I won't be scared.

43:32.500 --> 43:33.780
Even if Xiao Xun interferes,

43:34.100 --> 43:34.980
we have Xiao Yu.

43:35.660 --> 43:36.980
Three against three, then.

43:38.220 --> 43:39.140
Besides,

43:41.340 --> 43:42.940
you can fight against not only two,

43:44.740 --> 43:46.820
but even a hundred more.

44:00.140 --> 44:01.260
I want you to handle Deng Yi

44:01.300 --> 44:02.300
and Xie Yanfang.

44:02.940 --> 44:04.300
But Jiu, you look like

44:04.820 --> 44:06.220
you want to devour me.

44:15.620 --> 44:16.540
You should figure out

44:17.420 --> 44:18.380
how to handle Xiao Xun first.

44:19.180 --> 44:20.700
He suddenly proposed the sacrifice.

44:21.900 --> 44:22.540
He must have a plan.

44:24.300 --> 44:25.180
I know.

44:25.900 --> 44:26.420
You know?

44:28.260 --> 44:29.180
Then how can you

44:29.180 --> 44:29.940
remain so calm?

44:30.820 --> 44:32.380
If I panicked,

44:32.580 --> 44:33.820
what would that change?

44:35.420 --> 44:36.700
I prefer to stay put and wait.

44:37.460 --> 44:38.420
I'll see

44:39.340 --> 44:41.580
how he's going to play his game.

44:48.000 --> 44:52.800
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

44:52.800 --> 44:55.400
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

44:55.400 --> 44:58.960
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

45:01.800 --> 45:04.040
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

45:04.040 --> 45:05.640
♪And roars in the blaze♪

45:05.840 --> 45:08.720
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

45:09.080 --> 45:11.520
♪Fate imprisons me♪

45:11.640 --> 45:16.360
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

45:16.720 --> 45:20.720
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

45:21.000 --> 45:24.920
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

45:25.160 --> 45:29.920
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

45:30.600 --> 45:32.320
♪With no fear of the distance♪

45:32.440 --> 45:36.000
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

45:36.240 --> 45:40.400
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

45:40.760 --> 45:46.000
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

45:46.120 --> 45:49.520
♪My new pride♪

46:03.960 --> 46:06.640
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

46:07.120 --> 46:09.600
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

46:09.880 --> 46:11.600
♪Amidst the chaos♪

46:11.600 --> 46:17.520
♪I'll always be with you♪

46:17.600 --> 46:20.120
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

46:20.400 --> 46:21.640
♪And roars in the blaze♪

46:22.000 --> 46:24.800
